#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:8
msgid "导出与验收 Source SDK"
msgstr "Export and qualify a Source SDK"

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:10
msgid ""
"本页面向维护者。普通应用从已选源码或 SDK 消费，不执行整套 SDK 发布验证。 先冻结干净、已提交的平台源码，再选择 "
"package、后端和可选组件。"
msgstr ""
"This page is for maintainers. Ordinary applications consume selected source "
"or an SDK; they do not run the complete SDK release validation. First freeze"
" clean, committed platform source, then select the package, backend and "
"optional components."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:13
msgid "选择交付范围"
msgstr "Select the delivery scope"

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:15
msgid ""
"默认导出是精简 F4 裸机源码包；Native 模型和中间件须明确选入。包内容来源于 package 导出声明、选中依赖和许可记录，CMake "
"继续拥有源码／链接图。 完整维护消费者计划还需要 FreeRTOS、Native 和所用组件的供应方。从干净、已提交的 完整检出根目录执行："
msgstr ""
"The default export is a small F4 baremetal source package; Native models and"
" middleware require explicit selection. Package contents come from package "
"export declarations, selected dependencies and license records. CMake "
"continues to own the source and link graph. The complete maintainer consumer"
" plan also needs FreeRTOS, Native and the suppliers used by its components. "
"Run from the root of a clean, committed, complete checkout:"

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:25
msgid ""
"入口从维护消费者的装配声明及显式 CMake helper 需求选择供应方，准备依赖、导出并 搬迁临时 "
"SDK，核对源码提交后执行完整计划。未被消费者选择的库存不进入这份 SDK。 `NEXUS_BUILD_JOBS` 是本次消费者执行的总 worker "
"预算；同时执行其他工作时由协调者 分配预算。"
msgstr ""
"The entry point selects suppliers from the maintained consumer assemblies "
"and explicit CMake helper requirements, prepares dependencies, exports and "
"relocates a temporary SDK, then checks the source commit before executing "
"the complete plan. Inventory that no consumer selects stays out of this SDK."
" `NEXUS_BUILD_JOBS` is the total worker budget for this consumer invocation;"
" the coordinator allocates that budget when other work runs concurrently."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:30
msgid ""
"当前完整计划由 `tools/maintenance/consumer_profiles.py` 维护。读取新生成的 "
"`verification.json`、每条命令退出码、Native 运行结果、MCU ELF／BIN／map 和 "
"资源报告。不要缓存成功报告、过滤完整验收或把缺失执行补成通过。"
msgstr ""
"The current complete plan is maintained in "
"`tools/maintenance/consumer_profiles.py`. Read the newly generated "
"`verification.json`, every command exit code, Native execution results, MCU "
"ELF/BIN/map files and resource reports. Do not cache success reports, filter"
" complete acceptance or mark missing executions as passed."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:34
msgid "单独导出产品范围"
msgstr "Export a product scope separately"

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:36
msgid ""
"以下命令仅演示默认 F4 裸机产品包，不执行完整维护计划。普通应用只交付自己实际 选定的组件；需要其他组件或 Native "
"支撑时，在准备和导出时使用相同显式选择。 从干净、已提交的平台根目录执行："
msgstr ""
"The following commands demonstrate only the default F4 baremetal product "
"package; they do not execute the complete maintainer plan. Ordinary "
"applications deliver only their selected components. When other components "
"or Native support are needed, use the same explicit selection for "
"preparation and export. Run from the clean, committed platform root:"

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:46
msgid ""
"输出路径必须属于本次任务且尚未存在。制作器核对 clean source、gitlink、选中递归 依赖与许可，记录精确 source "
"revision／tree。默认包不能借完整计划的名义跳过缺失 消费者；小型包的完整性与其产品消费范围分别验收。"
msgstr ""
"The output path must belong to this task and must not already exist. The "
"packager checks clean source, gitlinks, selected recursive dependencies and "
"licenses, and records the exact source revision/tree. A default package "
"cannot claim the complete plan while skipping missing consumers; validate a "
"small package’s integrity and its product consumption scope separately."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:50
msgid "搬迁并核对产品交付"
msgstr "Relocate and check the product delivery"

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:58
msgid ""
"按[使用 Source SDK](../guides/use-source-sdk.md)配置、构建并执行所选产品消费者， 消费后再次核验整个 "
"prefix。自动完整计划的结果仅属于它实际导出的 SDK，不能代替 这份产品包的消费结果。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [use a Source SDK](../guides/use-source-sdk.md) to configure, build "
"and execute the selected product consumers, then verify the entire prefix "
"again. The automated complete plan’s results belong only to the SDK it "
"actually exported; they cannot replace the consumption results for this "
"product package."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:62
msgid ""
"SDK prefix 与验证输出必须是独立、无 symlink 别名的规范路径，不互相包含。路径 拒绝不清除无关目录；已接纳的验证器只管理自己的输出。"
msgstr ""
"The SDK prefix and verification output must be separate canonical paths, "
"without symlink aliases or containment in either direction. Rejecting a path"
" does not remove unrelated directories; an admitted verifier manages only "
"its own output."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:65
msgid "发布收条"
msgstr "Release receipt"

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:67
msgid ""
"收条至少关联平台 source revision／tree、profile、依赖、manifest、实际消费者范围、 "
"命令与退出码、产物及失败原件。消费前后完整性须一致；制作可下载归档时再验证 归档成员及校验和。软件结果、文档来源、版本标签和物理记录保持各自身份。"
msgstr ""
"The receipt must associate at least the platform source revision and tree, "
"profile, dependencies, manifest, actual consumer scope, commands and exit "
"codes, artifacts, and original failure records. Integrity must remain "
"unchanged before and after consumption. When creating a downloadable "
"archive, also verify its members and checksums. Software results, "
"documentation sources, version tags and physical records retain separate "
"identities."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:71
msgid ""
"维护源码不得依赖开发 fixture opt-in 获得正式包资格。`--development-fixture` 生成的包为 "
"nonpublishable；许可、来源、接口代际等错误不因 opt-in 放宽。 签名密钥、产品分区、制造数据和产品发布审批留在所属外部工程。"
msgstr ""
"Maintained source must not depend on a development-fixture opt-in to qualify"
" a formal package. Packages created with `--development-fixture` are "
"nonpublishable; opt-in does not relax license, provenance or interface-epoch"
" errors. Signing keys, product partitions, manufacturing data and product "
"release approval remain in their external projects."

#: ../../../../../nexus/docs/development/sdk-publishing.md:75
msgid ""
"示例仓先更新对应 gitlink、依赖锁、schema 与模板摘要，再执行其正常门禁。平台与 示例的提交分别记录。验收工具与公开 API 见 "
"[文档与维护工具参考](../reference/documentation-tools.md)，实际消费见 [使用 Source "
"SDK](../guides/use-source-sdk.md)。"
msgstr ""
"In the examples repository, update the relevant gitlink, dependency lock, "
"schema and template digests before executing its normal gates. Record "
"platform and examples commits separately. See [documentation and maintenance"
" tools](../reference/documentation-tools.md) for validation tools and public"
" APIs, and [use a Source SDK](../guides/use-source-sdk.md) for application "
"consumption."
